# assets directory
# Place static assets here: images, icons, fonts, videos.
#
# Recommended structure:
#   assets/
#     images/       – Raster images (PNG, JPG, WebP)
#     icons/        – SVG icons and icon sets
#     fonts/        – Self-hosted web fonts (if not using Google Fonts)
#     animations/   – Lottie JSON animation files
